        "text": "I understand new work best when I can see a diagram, picture or demonstration of it.",
        "style": "Visual"
      },
      {
        "text": "I remember more when someone explains the work to me out loud.",
        "style": "Auditory"
      },
      {
        "text": "I learn best by reading my notes or textbook carefully and then rewriting the key points.",
        "style": "Read/write"
      },
      {
        "text": "I learn best when I can try something myself, such as building, moving or doing a practical activity.",
        "style": "Kinesthetic"
      },
      {
        "text": "I use colour, mind maps or highlighted notes to help me remember information.",
        "style": "Visual"
      },
      {
        "text": "I talk my way through a problem, or read my notes out loud, when I am studying.",
        "style": "Auditory"
      },
      {
        "text": "I make lists, summaries or flashcards when I revise.",
        "style": "Read/write"
